{"id": "swebq0130", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "always", "audio_s": 2.14, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2073, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Drug overdose", "query": "what is jimi hendrix purple haze about?", "transcript": "What is Jimi Hendrix's Purple Haze about?", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "The song is mainly about a disorienting, dreamlike state—feeling confused, overwhelmed, and “not yourself,” possibly because of love or a spell-like attraction. Many listeners interpret it as being about psychedelic drugs, especially because of the title and imagery, but Jimi Hendrix said it was inspired by a dream and science-fiction/fantasy ideas, not specifically drug use.", "expert_answer": "“Purple Haze” is mainly about a disorienting, dreamlike state—feeling confused, overwhelmed, and “not yourself,” possibly because of love or a spell-like attraction.\n\nMany listeners interpret it as being about psychedelic drugs, especially because of the title and imagery, but Jimi Hendrix said it was inspired by a dream and science-fiction/fantasy ideas, not specifically drug use.", "expert_latency_s": 4.48, "stall_ms": 23, "relay_ms": 1651}
